HomePage -[hidden]down- VacanciesPage
VacanciesPage -[hidden]down- VacancyDetailPage
VacancyDetailPage -[hidden]down- LoginPage
LoginPage -[hidden]down- RegisterPage
ApplicationsPage -[hidden]down- ApplicationDetailPage
ApplicationDetailPage -[hidden]down- ApplicantCabinetPage
EmployerCabinetPage -[hidden]down- EmployerResponsesPage
ApplicantCabinetPage -[hidden]down- EmployerCabinetPage
EmployerResponsesPage -[hidden]down- ModeratorCabinetPage

PublicCatalogFlow -[hidden]down- AuthFlow
AuthFlow -[hidden]down- ApplicantFlow
ApplicantFlow -[hidden]down- EmployerFlow
EmployerFlow -[hidden]down- ModeratorFlow

AuthApi -[hidden]down- VacancyApi
VacancyApi -[hidden]down- ApplicationApi
ApplicationApi -[hidden]down- CabinetApi

AuthDomain -[hidden]down- VacancyDomain
VacancyDomain -[hidden]down- ApplicationDomain
ApplicationDomain -[hidden]down- ApplicationLineDomain
ApplicationLineDomain -[hidden]down- ProfileDomain
ProfileDomain -[hidden]down- EmployerResponsesDomain
EmployerResponsesDomain -[hidden]down- SystemDomain

AuthApi --> ApiClient
VacancyApi --> ApiClient
ApplicationApi --> ApiClient
CabinetApi --> ApiClient

PublicCatalogFlow ..> VacancyApi
PublicCatalogFlow ..> ApplicationApi
AuthFlow ..> AuthApi
ApplicantFlow ..> AuthApi
ApplicantFlow ..> CabinetApi
ApplicantFlow ..> ApplicationApi
EmployerFlow ..> CabinetApi
ModeratorFlow ..> CabinetApi
ModeratorFlow ..> ApplicationApi

